nt` was not re-run. The worker reports that `go vet ./...` stops on an unrelated testdata file, and the changed packages were vetted clean in the previous round.\n- Diff coverage: no per-line report. The new committer and gitx paths have named tests. The worker branch and `github.IsTransientToken` are thinly covered.\n\n## Previous findings\n- internal/closeout/closeout.go (Retry unconditional): still present\n- internal/worker/run.go (no worker test): still present\n- internal/committer/transient_test.go (redaction test): still present\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1266,"cache_read_input_tokens":31919,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1266},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d3c737a2-b58b-4ad1-b9b2-df621e9e8705","uuid":"414b4db6-adc9-4e28-921c-2060c821a943","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:58:23.190Z","request_id":"req_011ChPqsWuy6eyeXGrujYkyz"}
